\f1\b \cf0 Supplemental datasets required for the cleaning and labelling process. Important to note is that these are hand made
\f0\b0 \
\
1. wern_pre_dict.csv: is generated from copying four columns (order, question, raw_var, and final_var) from survey_code_translation.xlsx located in \'93WERN Survey/GSR_folder.\'94 This is necessary for the labelling process. \
2. response_type_likert_binary.csv\'94: is generated from copying the \'93final_var\'94 and \'93response-type\'94 column from survey_code_translation.xlsx located in \'93WERN Survey/GSR_folder.\'94 This would allow me to generate lists of response type questions to be cleaned en masse.\
\

