\f2\i Industry-specific weights
\f0\i0  (rk_wgt_ind) is calculated using industry-specific gender, age, and race distribution for employed workers from the 2021 ACS. Industry-specific weights should be used when generalizing to the population of workers in a specific industry. \
{\listtext	2.	}
\f2\i Final weights
\f0\i0  (rk_wgt_final) weights the sample to the population of employed workers in the 5 targeted industries. It is calculated by re-weighting rk_wgt_ind for workers in industry 
\f2\i j 
\f0\i0 by the share of workers in our five industries who were employed in industry 
\f2\i j 
\f0\i0 based on the 2021 ACS. Final weights should be used when generalizing to the population of people working in our 5 targeted industries. 
